1743+ 7B0C
1744+ 7B0C                  ; Punto 3: Mid-Left (X, Y + 7)
1745+ 7B0C ED 4B CF BA      ld   bc, (PlayerPos)
1746+ 7B10 78               ld   a, b
1747+ 7B11 C6 07            add  a, 7
1748+ 7B13 47               ld   b, a
