1951+ 7C07 CD 20 6B         call Gfx_DrawCrumblingTile
1952+ 7C0A D1               pop  de
1953+ 7C0B C1               pop  bc
1954+ 7C0C
1955+ 7C0C                  ; 3. Decrementa contatore blocchi attivi
1956+ 7C0C 21 DD C0         ld   hl, crumbling_active_count
1957+ 7C0F 35               dec  (hl)
1958+ 7C10
