1960+ 7C10 DD 23            inc  ix
1961+ 7C12 1C               inc  e
1962+ 7C13 7B               ld   a, e
1963+ 7C14 FE 20            cp   32
1964+ 7C16 38 03            jr   c, .col_ok
1965+ 7C18 1E 00            ld   e, 0
1966+ 7C1A 14               inc  d
1967+ 7C1B              .col_ok:
